{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2022-04-26 15:13:00', 'title': 'EXELON CORPORATION DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF EXELON CORPORATION DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.3375 PER SHARE ON EXELON'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON FRIDAY, JUNE 10, 2022, TO EXELON'S SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF 5 P.M. EASTERN TIME ON FRIDAY, MAY 13, 2022. ABOUT EXELON EXELON (NASDAQ: EXC) IS A FORTUNE 200 COMPANY AND THE NATION'S LARGEST UTILITY COMPANY, SERVING MORE THAN 10 MILLION CUSTOMERS THROUGH SIX FULLY REGULATED TRANSMISSION AND DISTRIBUTION UTILITIES"}